<title>POLAND: PETROBANK REVISES DOWN 1996 NET.</title>
<headline>PETROBANK REVISES DOWN 1996 NET.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrobank results for the</p>
<p>financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	  1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			13.33  vs   17.55</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  13.33  vs   17.55</p>
<p>    net profit				 7.63  vs   16.66</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Petrobank SA. Earlier bank</p>
<p>reported its net profit at 8.9 million zlotys</p>
<p>    revenues from securities		na   vs     na</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues     69.98  vs   58.65</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	  34.80  vs   23.25</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	     4.51  vs    2.27</p>
<p>    costs of commission		    0.40  vs    0.20</p>
<p>    income tax				 5.69  vs    2.87</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na   vs     na</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00  vs     na</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
